### Prompt C — Data Flow Diagram

> Generate a Mermaid `flowchart TD` with three labeled subgraphs:
> - `Frontend` containing nodes `UI_Trigger["User triggers outreach flow"]` and `API_Call["window.API.getOutreachReadiness() / window.API.generateOutreachMessage()"]`
> - `Backend` containing nodes `R1["GET /api/outreach/readiness"]`, `R2["POST /api/outreach/generate"]`, and `OM["outreach.py — compute_outreach_readiness() / generate_outreach_message()"]`
> - `DataLayer` containing `USERS["data/users.py — CURRENT_USER, USERS"]`
> - `AILayer` containing `MOCK["P4: Template Engine (no external call)"]` and `BEDROCK["P5: AWS Bedrock (amazon.titan-text-express-v1)"]`
>
> Edges: UI_Trigger→API_Call, API_Call→R1, API_Call→R2, R1→OM, R2→OM, OM→USERS, OM→MOCK, MOCK-.->BEDROCK (dotted, labeled "swap in P5"), OM→R1, OM→R2, R1→API_Call, R2→API_Call, API_Call→UI_Trigger

