### Prompt D — Component/Class Diagram

> Generate a Mermaid `classDiagram` with five classes and their members:
>
> **`app_py`** — all route handlers including:
> - Auth: `+login()`, `+register()`, `+change_password()`
> - Profile: `+get_me()`, `+update_me()`, `+get_profile_readiness()`, `+add_experience()`, `+add_education()`, `+add_skill()`
> - Outreach (Stories #1 & #7): `+generate_outreach()`, `+get_outreach_readiness()`
> - Other: `+get_users()`, `+get_feed()`, `+create_post()`, `+get_jobs()`, `+get_events()`, `+search()`
> - Helpers: `-_auth_user() dict`, `-_require_auth_user() dict`, `-_get_body() dict`, `-db database_py`, `-outreach_module outreach_py`
>
> **`get_profile_readiness_fields`** — response shape for `get_profile_readiness()`:
> `+score int`, `+sections list`, `+fixes list`, `~headline_len int`, `~about_len int`, `~skill_count int`, `~exp_count int`, `~edu_count int`, `~_status(section_score) str`
>
> **`outreach_py`** — `+generate_outreach_message(sender, recipient, context) dict`, `+compute_outreach_readiness(user) dict`, `-_call_ai(prompt) str`, `-_first_name(full_name) str`, `-_TONE_OPENERS dict`, `-_TONE_CLOSERS dict`, `-_OUTREACH_CHECKS list`
>
> **`database_py`** — all public data-access functions: `+verify_credentials(email, password) dict`, `+create_session(user_id) str`, `+get_session_user_id(token) int`, `+change_password(user_id, current_password, new_password) bool`, `+get_user_by_id(user_id) dict`, `+get_all_users(exclude_id) list`, `+update_current_user(updates, user_id) dict`, `+create_user(...) dict`, `+add_experience(user_id, entry) dict`, `+get_all_posts() list`, `+create_post(author_id, content, ...) dict`, `+toggle_post_like(post_id, user_id) dict`, `+get_conversations_for_user(user_id) list`, `+send_message(conv_id, sender_id, text) dict`, `+get_all_events_with_attendance(user_id) list`, `+toggle_event_attend(...)`, `+toggle_event_interest(...)`, `+search(q, exclude_user_id) dict`, `-_connect() Connection`, `-_execute(conn, sql, params) Cursor`, `-_hash_pw(pw) str`, `-_USE_PG bool`
>
> **`api_js`** — `+generateOutreachMessage(recipientId, tone, goal, customNote) Promise`, `+getOutreachReadiness(userId) Promise`, `+getProfileReadiness() Promise`, `+login(email, password) Promise`, `+getFeed() Promise`, `+getJobs() Promise`, `+getEvents() Promise`, `+search(q) Promise`
>
> Relationships: `app_py --> outreach_py : calls`, `app_py --> database_py : reads/writes`, `app_py ..> get_profile_readiness_fields : returns shape`, `api_js --> app_py : HTTP JSON`
